blocks.en:
Baselines. For each base model, we report four configurations following the structure of Table 1 :
(1) Base Model , i.e., the original frozen LLM with standard decoding;
(2) CopyGen , which applies our decoding-time plugin to the frozen base model;
(3) Base Model SFT {}_{\text{SFT}} , which applies supervised finetuning using LoRA [ 10 ] ;
and (4) CopyGen SFT {}_{\text{SFT}} , which combines our plugin with the SFT-adapted model.
This setup allows us to separate the effects of decoding-time control from those of parameter-efficient finetuning, and to test whether the two are complementary.

blocks.zh:
基线。 对于每个基本模型,我们按照表1的结构报告四个配置:
(1) 基准模型,即原被冻结的有标准解码的LLM;
(2) CopyGen,将我们的解码时间插件应用于被冻结的基模型;
(3)基础模型. SFT QQText{SFT},使用LORA进行有监督的微调;
和 (4) CopyGen SFT QQText{SFT},它结合了我们的插件和SFT所适应的模型.
这个设置使我们能够将解码时间控制的效果与参数效率微调的效果区分开来,并测试两者是否互补.

blocks.en:
To examine both the accuracy and efficiency of CopyGen, we further compare it against three families of baselines that exploit the source text during decoding, as reported in Table 2 :
(1) Lossless Source-Reuse Acceleration , including LLMA [ 28 ] and CopySpec [ 6 ] , which speeds up decoding while preserving the base model’s output distribution;
(2) Rule-Based Source Constraints , including a PICARD-style [ 24 ] decoder that masks generation to source-consistent continuations and a non-learned Longest-Copy rule that directly copies the longest matched source continuation;
and and (3) Learned Copy Mechanisms , represented by CopySpan [ 21 ] , a span-level pointer-generator network trained on top of the frozen LM.
We also evaluate three frontier LLMs, GPT-4.1-nano [ 19 ] , Gemini-2.5-Flash-Lite [ 4 ] , and DeepSeek-V4-Pro [ 5 ] , under the same protocol (Table 16 ).

blocks.zh:
为了审查CopyGen的准确性和效率,我们进一步将它与表2所汇报的在解码过程中利用源文本的三组基线相比较:
(1) 无损失源再利用加速,包括LLMA[28]和CopySpec[6],这些加速了解码,同时保持了基准模型的输出分布;
(2) 基于规则的源限制,包括一种PICARD式的[24]解码器,将生成遮掩到与源相符合的续作,以及一种不吸取最长规则,直接复制最长匹配源续作;
和(3) 学习复制机制,由CopySpan[21]代表,一个跨级指向器-生成器网络在被冻结的LM上方训练.
我们还根据同一协议评估三个前沿LLMs、GPT-4.1-nano[19]、双子座2.5-Flash-Lite[4]和DeepSeek-V4-Pro[5](表16)。
